Spec: Native runtime-only pipe instances

Purpose:
  Keep a live private Windows pipe namespace reserved for the Agent's held runtime.

Owns:
  ./RuntimePipe.cs

Must:
  Use per-run unpredictable local-only byte pipes with explicit current-user/SYSTEM ACL and a first-instance reservation.
  Keep an existing instance alive while allocating its successor; bound instances at sixty-four and use overlapped cancellation.
  Obtain the actual client PID from the kernel handle; never accept a caller-supplied PID as identity.
